.TH SANCHALA-ACCENT-COLOR 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-accent-color \- System-wide accent color customization
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-accent-color
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIcolor\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a system-wide accent color that applies across KDE Plasma and GTK applications.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B set \fIcolor\fR
Set accent color (preset name or #RRGGBB hex)
.TP
.B presets
List available color presets
.TP
.B current
Show current accent color
.TP
.B auto \fIon|off\fR
Enable/disable automatic color from wallpaper
.SH PRESETS
blue, purple, pink, red, orange, yellow, green, teal, cyan, graphite
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Set blue accent:
.B sanchala-accent-color set blue
.TP
Set custom color:
.B sanchala-accent-color set "#e91e63"
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sanchala/accent-color/config.json
Configuration file
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
